gin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3038\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjuFcvbt0z7qWl2edC_YgbUh9bfTEAngxQuWbP9Fsx5-KdjAdhyyZoL2F1byynOWGG-vPbtbpDPu6z4UqIK_O6pmzAVw2JZx_hxCGeHSvpmBlGql6lVQIOczB7ckfB1laJTXtHoGFf6LXwo-QvMzKEldUVkxNM_8po5322I_BTnH43AfZocuzT09hNSLvnb=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">8月初5，天iáu未光，tân雷公、閃sih-nah，擾吵tng-leh做美夢ê我，無leh講sńg笑，hia雨落kah ná像天公伯--à kā規面盆ê水做一下倒--落-來仝款。橫直to hōo雷公吵驚醒--ah，規氣來pué手機仔，pué開一下看tsiah知影tsit tsūn雨ē落tsiânn久，mā因為雨siunn大，排水空消tháu bē離，造成真濟區域漲水。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">無ta-uâ，台南市政府緊急宣佈停班停課一工，tsit工台語認證A卷ê考試就延後--ah。Suà--落-來氣象局報導南部有可能koh有致災性ê大雨，所以暗頭仔市政府mā決定隔tńg工koh再停班停課一工，就án-ne B卷ê考試也延後舉行。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">老師tī線頂發訊息kā阮鼓勵，m̄免煩惱，逐家安全重要，kā考試延後當做是天公伯--à好意ê禮物，逐家有koh-khah濟時間好好仔準備。M̄-koh我是一个真gâu緊張ê人，聽著考試延後，並無khah歡喜，顛倒hōo我khah tsiau-tso，m̄知tsit場考試ē tshiân到啥mih時tsūn。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">等--啊等，總算接著通知--ah，佳哉延後兩禮拜niâ，考試前幾工，將khah生疏ê語詞、俗諺語加強練習以外，koh利用上熱門ê「AI」軟體，練習我上hân-bān ê口語，希望tsit過ē-tàng順利通過中高級。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">考試tsit日，早早來到考場，一下入門就看著阮台語學會上課ê老師、熱心服務ê學長、學姊，逐家無閒tshih-tshih ，有人負責款四秀仔，有人泡咖啡、泡茶。逐項mi̍h件lóng款kah有夠tsiâu備，bē輸一間kám仔店kah一个大家庭仝款，歇睏區鬧熱ê氣氛，hōo阮無hiah緊張不安，萬分感動也真感謝in無私ê奉獻。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">第一場ê口語測驗，雖然心內iáu是緊張kah phi̍h-pho̍k跳，m̄-koh有頭一回ê經驗，加上考試ê座位拄仔好邊--a lóng無考生，無受著干擾，算是tsiânn順利。下晡ê聽力測驗感覺就有khah挑戰，因為題目kan-na唸一擺，就隨ài回答，有ê題目是唸kah lò-lò長，koh像leh se̍h-lin-long siō-siāng，一下無注意聽，就m̄知beh按怎回答。Suà--落-來ê閱讀kah書寫測驗，感覺就khah順序輕鬆--小-可-仔，也有kā平常時ê水準發揮--出-來。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">考試總算完成，回想家己ê表現，總--是有不足ê所在，m̄-koh tse lóng是經驗累積，mā是家己學習ê成績單。俗語講：「毛毛仔雨落久，塗mā ē tâm」，我相信一步一跤印ê學習，台語能力定著ē愈來愈進步，也感謝有tsiah-nī濟有志共同tshui-sak lán ê母語，希望lán ê母語ē-tàng tsiânn做逐家開喙就ē-hiáu講ê語言。</span></div></div><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; text-align: left;\"><span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi10RzPL1r0HYReHsGye0eDuRyBKDCLJ57vMqDHjPrnDx_EWJp4Cn2qS-4oj_eZsSxDSjLcalOOcubtFCahnMprqZSSeYamKS7-SCD3aWHUQuLp7Z3rFgVXRkEcyd0vdxaBFCIpIK-VBPjLRjeNNkMr9e_6-3GRcxGZvEKqFK1s4pJHyVMwMXimScyOrPqQ\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3035\" data-original-width=\"2129\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi10RzPL1r0HYReHsGye0eDuRyBKDCLJ57vMqDHjPrnDx_EWJp4Cn2qS-4oj